    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-e043c827ebc3cfe340a583ef1b8a6f2821c7d945",
      "source_path": "docs/guide.md",
      "display_text": "# Guide\n\nScope introduction. The scope refers to the [ancestor condition](other.md#ancestor-only).\n\n",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 4
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-b9bc924d4c7c0eb93e28967c932339463ad30e96",
      "source_path": "docs/guide.md",
      "display_text": "## Empty\n\n",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 6
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-67396f55c70ba70eccd3115db7f39f735c704bc8",
      "source_path": "docs/guide.md",
      "display_text": "### Selected\n\nKeep this condition [limits](#limits) and [more][ref].\n\nConsult the [absent condition](other.md#absent), [whole document](other.md), and [restricted condition](modules/private.md#hidden).\n\nAlso retain the <a href=\"other.md#condition&amp;amp;gate\">required condition</a>.\n\n- [Index entry](other.md#navigation-only)\n\n| Item | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| A | B[^note] |\n\n",
      "line_start": 7,
      "line_end": 20
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-84d83866ac88e9d50d7668c99cf74f6cf8865ed2",
      "source_path": "docs/guide.md",
      "display_text": "#### Tail\n\nTail condition stays.\n\n",
      "line_start": 21,
      "line_end": 24
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-819798be4c625a79752f23328b7f2967a0443753",
      "source_path": "docs/guide.md",
      "display_text": "## Noise\n\nUnselected noise.\n\n",
      "line_start": 25,
      "line_end": 28
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-e19f4b4afeaed16d9bfef2cf101df5a97e305bdd",
      "source_path": "docs/guide.md",
      "display_text": "## Limits\n\nLimit condition [cycle](#selected).\n\n",
      "line_start": 29,
      "line_end": 32
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-7d15fe18a84fc6aa0c2b6310b689e43fec7ee3c7",
      "source_path": "docs/guide.md",
      "display_text": "## Notes\n\n[^note]: Footnote condition.\n    Continued footnote.\n\n[ref]:\n  other.md#remote\n",
      "line_start": 33,
      "line_end": 39
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-195b96879db3d5339e7032f4ff1bd9e53751df3c",
      "source_path": "docs/other.md",
      "display_text": "# Other\n\nOther introduction.\n\n",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 4
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-33abf81e4e4000016619196651e8b2b229b50719",
      "source_path": "docs/other.md",
      "display_text": "## Remote\n\nRemote condition [missing](private.md#hidden). The remote condition also depends on [second step](#second-hop).\n\n",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 8
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-ac91955bd6d7ab5bae81d996798abfa6547d68ab",
      "source_path": "docs/other.md",
      "display_text": "## Ancestor only\n\nAncestor-only condition is not automatically fetched.\n\n",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 12
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-0c7555d6b094851bf352ea85314dc7812ec6e33b",
      "source_path": "docs/other.md",
      "display_text": "## Navigation only\n\nNavigation-only content is not automatically fetched.\n\n",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 16
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-f3d6ed61d3605837a7023619bc2fe3721d7253d0",
      "source_path": "docs/other.md",
      "display_text": "## Second hop\n\nSecond-hop condition is not automatically fetched.\n\n",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 20
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-6004c78ee66081c1eb40c0513cfb8e661e81b662",
      "source_path": "docs/other.md",
      "display_text": "## Correct entity condition\n\n<a id=\"condition&amp;amp;gate\"></a>\n\nThe single-decoded entity condition must be retained.\n\n",
      "line_start": 21,
      "line_end": 26
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-ad255b415d24eca731f5a30dba63fe36ff2f8443",
      "source_path": "docs/other.md",
      "display_text": "## Wrong entity condition\n\n<a id=\"condition&amp;gate\"></a>\n\nThe double-decoded entity condition must not be substituted.\n",
      "line_start": 27,
      "line_end": 31
    },
    {
      "stable_chunk_id": "child-8a47ed4ffcc3775dda70e296bd3adddfda2b5aff",
      "source_path": "docs/modules/private.md",
      "display_text": "# Hidden\n\nRestricted condition must remain outside project scope.\n",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 3
    }
  ],
